      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: positive-inspirational; overall-intent-description: The scene depicts a joyful, affectionate moment between a Black man and a young girl, likely his daughter, sharing a happy, intimate interaction. The text overlays describe a positive personal transformation: 'then something amazing started to happen!' followed by 'last year tyrone got a new job, started building his credit, and spending more time with his kids.' The overall intent is to convey a message of hope, personal growth, and the value of family time. There is no toxicity present in the image or text. The meme uses the visual of a loving family moment to analogically map onto the textual narrative of overcoming adversity through hard work and prioritizing family, aiming to inspire viewers with a story of positive change and resilience. The content is uplifting and does not contain any abusive, cyberbullying, harmful, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic elements.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
